# Enveloped in Darkness (sandoria 85) with its era module (quest rework B3b, Task 9):
# modules/era/lua/quests/sandoria/enveloped_in_darkness.lua, enabled by its condition xi.pre(xi.expansion.SOA)
# (RESTRICT_CONTENT 1, ENABLE_SOA 0), replaces section 2's Crawlers' Nest onEventFinish 4 with a copy of the quest's own
# whose option 1 sets Time = JstMidnight() (1800025200, seven hours after the harness clock's 1800000000), where the
# quest's own sets now + 30 (1800000030). Accepted by GM at Prog 3 with the Crawler Blood and the Old Boots, beside qm8:
# 4 finished with option 0 and with option 2 (both sides of option == 1: nothing), then with option 1 (the module's
# Time, both key items deleted, YOU_BURY_THE); EQUIPMENT_NOT_PURIFIED before the JST midnight; a JST day later 5
# (completed: Warlock's Boots, fame +20).
module modules/era/lua/quests/sandoria/enveloped_in_darkness.lua
lists CrawlersNest/qm8/onTrigger CrawlersNest/onEventFinish/4 CrawlersNest/onEventFinish/5
char zone=CrawlersNest pos=58.9,0.4,69 job=RDM lvl=50
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_SOA 0
quest Sandoria.TheCrimsonTrial completed
quest Sandoria.EnvelopedInDarkness accepted
charvar Quest[0][85]Prog 3
keyitem CrawlerBlood
keyitem OldBoots
login
trigger qm8                               # Prog 3, no Time, the blood and the boots: 4
finish                                    # option 0 (below 1): nothing; the key items kept
trigger qm8                               # 4
finish option=2                           # option 2 (above 1): nothing
trigger qm8                               # 4
finish option=1                           # Time = JstMidnight() (the module), not now + 30; both deleted; YOU_BURY_THE
trigger qm8                               # Time not reached: EQUIPMENT_NOT_PURIFIED
wait jst=1                                # past the next JST midnight
trigger qm8                               # Time reached: 5
finish                                    # completed: Warlock's Boots, fame +20
